  <item>
    <title>启笛说008 | 郭存海：“唐罗主义”时代，该怎么理解拉丁美洲？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0f3269e1eb34a939dae23a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a0f3269e1eb34a939dae23a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>【内容简介】</span></h2><p><span>2026年初，美国袭击委内瑞拉事件引发了全球的关注。结合在此前后美国的几度动作，“唐罗主义”的概念被越来越多的人关注，拉丁美洲也获得了巨大的关注焦点。</span></p><p><span>作为和美国独立时间相近，却又长期限于发展停滞的大陆，这片往往被描述为“魔幻”的大陆究竟有着怎样的面貌与困境？拉丁美洲和中国相隔天涯海角，这片土地又和中国有着怎样的关联？</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾作为拉丁美洲的研究学者，从拉丁美洲数个国家的属性面貌，讨论在“唐罗主义”到来的大环境下，我们究竟应该如何理解拉丁美洲这片遥远的世界。</span></p><p></p><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><p><span>郭存海，中国社会科学院拉丁美洲研究所社会文化研究室主任，阿根廷研究中心执行主任；兼任中拉教科文中心（CECLA）协调员。</span></p><p></p><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 拉丁美洲的基本状况是什么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 委内瑞拉在拉丁美洲有什么特色之处？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 中国在拉丁美洲的存在究竟有多么深入？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 为什么中国人需要理解“拉丁美洲”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 阿根廷通常会给人形成怎样的错觉？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 巴西发展的问题究竟植根于何处？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2441">40:41</a> 墨西哥人为什么认为自己的现代性是残缺的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> 环境因素如何影响加勒比的发展？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2886">48:06</a> 拉丁美洲的“民族性”为什么需要一种“重建”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3447">57:27</a> 过去和现在的美国对拉丁美洲的影响路线有何同异？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3818">63:38</a> 中国未来和拉丁美洲的关系走向会如何？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4217">70:17</a> 拉丁美洲的左右摇摆接下来会怎么走？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4360">72:40</a> 期望读者从“理解拉丁美洲”中收获到什么？</span></p><p></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqN9EoAB_OlXn6Kb59pEqm22Qln2.jpg"></figure><p><a href="https://item.jd.com/10059160789725.html?pcdk=FozeA6kqDuITGrP2F6yQpEGlgYoLfP0QoGGPOUslJp1ioYnHcBeQ8VoKFAaiY6na.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuNCUyM3NrdV9jYXJkJTQwMTc3OTM4MDY0OTU3MyUyMzE3NzkzODA1OTY3NjkxNzcyODI2OTg1JTIzMjA3NTA2MjI5MQ" data-url="https://item.jd.com/10059160789725.html?pcdk=FozeA6kqDuITGrP2F6yQpEGlgYoLfP0QoGGPOUslJp1ioYnHcBeQ8VoKFAaiY6na.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuNCUyM3NrdV9jYXJkJTQwMTc3OTM4MDY0OTU3MyUyMzE3NzkzODA1OTY3NjkxNzcyODI2OTg1JTIzMjA3NTA2MjI5MQ"><span>《阿根廷迷思》</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGw1f2wIdhqbwtT3DMZF8cQr4No.jpeg"></figure><p><a href="https://item.jd.com/10100855602143.html?pcdk=tq1GRo0ZPm3sFaeUJRwD1mPjsI1aBjAIHDYZxO2tIaFc0T_B5ukEMYEFUA3hXer2.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuMTElMjNza3VfY2FyZCU0MDE3NzkzODA2OTkzMTglMjMxNzc5MzgwNTk2NzY5MTc3MjgyNjk4NSUyMzI4NTI4NjgwNQ" data-url="https://item.jd.com/10100855602143.html?pcdk=tq1GRo0ZPm3sFaeUJRwD1mPjsI1aBjAIHDYZxO2tIaFc0T_B5ukEMYEFUA3hXer2.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuMTElMjNza3VfY2FyZCU0MDE3NzkzODA2OTkzMTglMjMxNzc5MzgwNTk2NzY5MTc3MjgyNjk4NSUyMzI4NTI4NjgwNQ"><span>《巴西之根》</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpRLyaD5yTsrCs0eyQrKBYLiUuzX.jpg"></figure><p><a href="https://item.jd.com/14323333.html?pcdk=gwC_1i3Us9ZIRLOsIUQibgEJIWpG3LWEmb_RSPv_mCk2SdvFpdP7ook8tWsFYA-G.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuMiUyM3NrdV9jYXJkJTQwMTc3OTM4MDc0NTcyNyUyMzE3NzkzODA1OTY3NjkxNzcyODI2OTg1JTIzOTM3NjMzODYy" data-url="https://item.jd.com/14323333.html?pcdk=gwC_1i3Us9ZIRLOsIUQibgEJIWpG3LWEmb_RSPv_mCk2SdvFpdP7ook8tWsFYA-G.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuMiUyM3NrdV9jYXJkJTQwMTc3OTM4MDc0NTcyNyUyMzE3NzkzODA1OTY3NjkxNzcyODI2OTg1JTIzOTM3NjMzODYy"><span>《忧郁的牢笼：墨西哥人的身份与异变》</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvKq32YmBWHCDaBt8RGHIdV3uSH.jpg"></figure><p><a href="https://item.jd.com/10107618727372.html?pcdk=SGrbmY82ZDZ6Q7zl-LT10G__liBTzSr3M0NCIW7lsunz3PoQbWoDauekv2rof5GD.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuMjclMjNza3VfY2FyZCU0MDE3NzkzODA3OTYyNDIlMjMxNzc5MzgwNTk2NzY5MTc3MjgyNjk4NSUyMzk0MjAxMDEyNA" data-url="https://item.jd.com/10107618727372.html?pcdk=SGrbmY82ZDZ6Q7zl-LT10G__liBTzSr3M0NCIW7lsunz3PoQbWoDauekv2rof5GD.3z6a.aI3x&amp;spmTag=YTAyNDAuYjAwMjQ5My5jMDAwMDQwMjcuMjclMjNza3VfY2FyZCU0MDE3NzkzODA3OTYyNDIlMjMxNzc5MzgwNTk2NzY5MTc3MjgyNjk4NSUyMzk0MjAxMDEyNA"><span>《加勒比海五百年》</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号“启笛fons”，</span></p><p><span>买嘉宾的书就是对我们最好的打赏。</span></p>]]></description>
